+# cloud-init ships with releng. Disabling its datasources (see
+# configs/airootfs/etc/cloud/cloud.cfg.d/99-omarchy-disable.cfg) is not enough:
+# the services stay enabled, so cloud-init still runs its modules (SSH host-key
+# generation, etc.) and logs to the kernel console. That console is the active
+# VT, so the output paints over the installer's TUI on tty1 during boot. Omarchy
